' ========================================================================================
' Number, in minutes, an operating system is offset from Greenwich mean time (GMT).
' The number is positive, negative, or zero.
' Usage example:
' var (timeZone, hr, errInfo) = wmiGetOSCurrentTimeZone()
' print timeZone
' if hr then print errInfo
